5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We need a system that is sustainable. The current informal habit is failing, and we should clarify the costs and expectations before deciding.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. We need a realistic understanding of the time commitment involved. If it's too high, we should consider other options.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests we first analyze the correlation between space usage and the actual workload. It would be a pity to distribute burdens blindly.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I just want to stop playing the guessing game. One day the kitchen is a dream, the next it's a nightmare. We need consistency, people!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. More than the cleaning itself, I want us to find a way that keeps us all happy and friendly for the whole year.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@May, consistency requires a clear standard. We should look into what each person actually considers ""done"" to avoid these discrepancies.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, standards are one thing, but the actual hours spent are another. We need to know the real time cost of a full pass.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. I am curious if the burden is truly shared or if some of us are merely ghosts in the house while others do the heavy lifting.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,Exactly! And the bathroom... let's just say I have to brace myself before entering. We need to know why the quality fluctuates so wildly.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried that if we focus too much on who does what, we might start blaming each other. Let's look at the usage patterns first.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I am also concerned about the supplies. We need to track the expenses for bleach and bags to ensure no one is unfairly out of pocket.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If the time cost is too high, we should compare it to the cost of a professional firm. It might be a more rational trade-off.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A professional firm is an elegant solution, provided the cost is distributed logically. Let's gather the data on both usage and professional rates.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm all for a professional if it means I don't have to wonder if the bathroom is a biohazard today. Let's check the grout and the standards.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think looking at the house chat or the calendar might show us where the friction points are. I want to avoid future arguments.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's proceed with the investigations. I'll focus on the financial side and the standards of completion.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the actual time required and the professional alternatives.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the usage patterns and the records of who has actually been contributing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm going for the grout and the definitions of ""done."" I need to know why the quality is so unpredictable!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll check the house chat and the calendar. I want to see how we've been communicating about this so we can do better.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
